setMaintenanceMargin.t.sol
├── when caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with {OwnableUnauthorizedAccount} error
└── when caller is the owner
    ├── when the new maintenance margin is zero
    │   └── it should revert with {PERPEX__INVALID_MAINTENANCE_MARGIN} error
    └── when the new maintenance margin is not zero
        ├── it should update the maintenance margin
        └── it should emit the {MaintenanceMarginUpdated} event
